      "message": "[error] Line 69: 🔴 `Math.multiplyExact(device.lastSync, 1000L)` can throw `ArithmeticException` for large/untrusted values and crash the account settings screen while rendering a device row. `lastSync` ultimately comes from daemon/account data, so UI formatting should be defensive. Replace this with a bounded conversion (e.g., range-check against `Long.MAX_VALUE / 1000`, then multiply, otherwise treat as unknown/\"Never\"), or catch overflow and fallback to the non-crashing path.",
